# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated 1C artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# build/ holds compiled *.cfe, disposable infobases (build/ib), the staged
# release source tree (build/release/QrGenerator), the packed component
# (build/dist) and vendored tool downloads (build/vendor). All of it is
# rebuildable. It is also where the render example writes its sample picture.
build/
out/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored OneScript dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Restored from packagedef via opm.
oscript_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Native component build products
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The ZIP that carries the component is a release asset, never a source file:
# tools/1c-release/build-release-src.sh injects it into a staged copy of the
# extension as a binary template. Nothing here should ever be committed.
rust/target/
# rust-analyzer writes its flycheck scratch output here at the workspace root.
/target/
*.so
*.dll
*.dylib
*.zip

# The label font is the one binary that IS a source file: it is compiled into the
# library with include_bytes!, and the build cannot run without it. It is tracked
deliberately — see rust/crates/addin/assets/README.md for its provenance.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent tooling state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.serena/cache/
.serena/logs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Temporary files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local overrides
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*.local.json
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Licence files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A 1C licence is issued to an organisation and is a secret. The file is kept in the
# repository root for convenience — tools/1c-platform/install-licence.sh copies it
# into /var/1C/licenses inside the container — but it must never be committed.
*.lic
1Cv8Licence

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference material shipped by 1C
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The two .bsl modules are the shipped УНФ barcode generator, kept as the design
# reference for the wrapper and the reuse module (CC BY 4.0, headers retained).
# The 10 MB component that comes with them is not part of this project and is
# redistributed from neither side: it stays on disk, out of history.
docs/examples/КомпонентаПечатиШтрихкодов
